{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49359","headline":"感恩多 一 · 牛峤","name":"感恩多 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两条红粉泪，多少香闺意。\n强攀桃李枝，歛愁眉。\n陌上莺啼蝶舞，柳花飞。\n柳花飞，愿得郎心，忆家还早归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}